# The claim-head conjunct of Armed dropped: an activation arms without replaying
# to the head its claim returned, so it passes another activation's appends
# below it. Moved from the design's mutation of the same name. It edits the Armed
# predicate, not an action, so it names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestNoClaimHeadReplay
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms without replaying to its claim head

--- FIND
    /\ mInit
    /\ rp[a] >= claimHead[a] - 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ mInit
\* MUTATION: no replay to the claim head.
--- END
